#: chaotic_pfc.cli.paper_figures:3 of
msgid ""
"Figures are rendered at their *final printed size*, so the font sizes "
"requested here are the font sizes that end up on the page. This is the "
"only way to keep figure typography consistent with the body text: a 12 x "
"5 in figure squeezed into a 3.5 in column shrinks a 16 pt label down to "
"4.7 pt."
msgstr ""
"Figures are rendered at their *final printed size*, so the font sizes "
"requested here are the font sizes that end up on the page. This is the "
"only way to keep figure typography consistent with the body text: a 12 x "
"5 in figure squeezed into a 3.5 in column shrinks a 16 pt label down to "
"4.7 pt."



